              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku ligasa lyakwe lya kumlyo ŵanyakwile ndondwa msano ni siŵili, soni mkamwa mwakwe mwapali upanga wakutema kosekose uwakopocele pasa. Ngope jakwe jaliji jakuŵala mnope mpela mulikusaŵalila lyuŵa musi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
